{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415737","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415737","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041573701:1":{"text":"時に、憎しみは信念をも凌駕する力となる。","source_cn":"仇恨有时比信念更简单。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACC192BFF202A0F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573702:1":{"text":"まるで錆びることのない剣のようで、何も考えず延々と振るい続けられる。","source_cn":"它像一把不会钝的剑，让你无需思考，只需挥砍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x643FDD64A1A00E6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573703:1":{"text":"……そしていつか、斬ってはいけないものまで斬ってしまうのだろう。","source_cn":"直到砍到不该砍的东西，比如呼临城的未来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2F8807DEFDBCEB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573704:1":{"text":"司令官殿、あなたが本当に恐れているのは、心の迷いではありませんか？","source_cn":"统帅阁下，你真正恐惧的，是放下这把剑之后的迷茫吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ACBF45660D352D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573705:1":{"text":"分からない……俺にはもう、何も分からないのだ。","source_cn":"我分不清了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EC4C98A26804866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573706:1":{"text":"開戦を命じるたび、脳裏をよぎるのは、守り抜くと誓った国か……それとも、失ったルウの面影か。それすらも分からない。","source_cn":"当我下令开战时，眼前时而是我誓言守护的城邦，时而是……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12733CF5D2F2BDEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573707:1":{"text":"私情に目を曇らされた司令官ほど、哀れなものはないと思わないか？","source_cn":"女士，一个被个人情感蒙蔽双眼的统帅，是否比一个纯粹的冷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16D97376E23842DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573708:1":{"text":"いいえ。むしろそれこそ、あなたの心がまだ生きている証拠です。","source_cn":"不。这恰巧说明你的道德感仍在起作用。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A19AD2FFD3F2A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573709:1":{"text":"肝心なのは、あなたがルウさん一人への責任と、この国の民への責任を分けて考えられるかどうかです。","source_cn":"关键在于，你能否将对露一人的责任与对一城人的责任重新区分开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2FC53A8AFD5622A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573710:1":{"text":"理性が戻りつつあるからこそ、そこに迷いが生じているのでしょう。","source_cn":"你的犹豫，正是理性回归的征兆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34CDD1BE041A5AB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573711:1":{"text":"つまり、俺の迷いは逆に希望でもあると？ふっ、なんとも皮肉だな。","source_cn":"所以，我的弱点反而成了希望？真是讽刺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D27AE8FDC3BA993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573712:1":{"text":"皮肉ではありません。これはバランスの問題です。","source_cn":"并非讽刺，是平衡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA40C9D5497345562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573713:1":{"text":"冷酷なだけでは、ただの殺戮兵器になってしまいますし、感情に溺れるだけでは、司令官としての責務を果たせなくなります。","source_cn":"完全的冷酷会让你沦为战争机器，而彻底的沉溺则会让你辜负...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD68EEADB2A93945B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573714:1":{"text":"己の揺らぎを認めることが、偏った思考から抜け出す第一歩です。","source_cn":"承认这份不确定性，恰恰是你走出偏执的第一步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x058710DB228F3502","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573715:1":{"text":"ならば、大義を徹底して貫くことも、私情に溺れきることもできない者は……","source_cn":"那么，依你之见，一个既无法彻底拥抱大义，又无法完全沉溺...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D08B10041CE4993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573716:1":{"text":"次の戦いで、どう指揮を執ればいいと思う？","source_cn":"该如何在下一场战役中下令？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68F8801DCD0D3967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041573717:1":{"text":"あなたの初志に従うのです。","source_cn":"遵循你最初的本能——减少无谓的杀戮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF633CAE95D8D44D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041573718:1":{"text":"戦いの終わった夜、あなたが己の民と思い出の両方と向き合えるために。","source_cn":"为了让你在战后之夜，能同时面对你的人民和你的记忆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18F0AA4A7BD2CCFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041573719:1":{"text":"それが真の責任の在り方だと、私は思います。","source_cn":"这是真正的责任所在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01D67B02E716408B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:珀尔修斯":{"text":"ペルセウス","source":"珀尔修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"イフリー","source":"伊芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":2}}